    "body": "Thanks for pointing out the problem with the `watchingAdvertisements` attribute as well.\r\n\r\nWe're tracking this on the implementation side as [Chromium issue 1345995](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1345995) which is blocking marking `watchAdvertisements()` as a stable API.",
